  "practice": [
    "Say ধ three times with a puff of air: dhô, dhô, dhô.",
    "Practice the vowel forms: ধ (dhô), ধা (dha), ধি (dhi), ধী (dhi), ধু (dhu), ধূ (dhu), ধে (dhe), ধৈ (dhoi), ধো (dho), and ধৌ (dhou).",
    "Read the combinations aloud: ধ + া = ধা as in ধান, ধ + ী = ধী as in ধীর, ধ + ু = ধু as in ধুলো, ধ + ূ = ধূ as in ধূসর, ধ + ৈ = ধৈ as in ধৈর্য, and ধ + ো = ধো as in ধোয়া.",
    "Compare দ (d) with ধ (dh, extra air): দাদা / ধান, দরজা / ধরা, and দিন / ধীর.",
    "Use ধন্যবাদ, ধরা, ধারণা, ধীরে, ধুলো, ধোঁয়া, ধৈর্য, and ধান as quick reading anchors.",
    "Memorize these immediately useful phrases: অনেক ধন্যবাদ, ধীরে বলুন, and আমার কোনো ধারণা নেই."
  ],
  "notes": [
    "ধ is a very common Bangla consonant named dhô. It is the aspirated partner of দ and is pronounced with a little more air.",
    "The vowel-sign forms include ধ (dhô), ধা (dha), ধি (dhi), ধী (dhi), ধু (dhu), ধূ (dhu), ধে (dhe), ধৈ (dhoi), ধো (dho), and ধৌ (dhou). Examples include ধর্ম, ধান, ধিক্কার, ধীর, ধুলো, ধূসর, ধেয়ে, ধৈর্য, ধোয়া, and ধৌত.",
    "Compare দরজা (dorja, door) with ধরা (dhora, to catch/hold), and দিন (din, day) with ধীর (dhir, slow).",
    "Best words to memorize include ধন্যবাদ, ধরা, ধরো, ধরে, ধরন, ধারণা, ধান, ধনী, ধীর, ধীরে, ধুলো, ধোয়া, ধোঁয়া, ধাক্কা, ধাপ, ধৈর্য, ধারালো, ধ্বনি, ধ্বংস, and ধূসর."
